{"data": [{"id": "2122133801489084844", "author_id": "1490950408272896085", "text": "@kimmonismus 这种策略会不会导致发布节奏太慢，让人摸不着头脑？", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T01:05:00.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/daveylan2/status/2122133801489084844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122131354804711436", "author_id": "2106392864544768000", "text": "@kimmonismus If research compute is the constraint, a delayed release tells us surprisingly little about capability progress. \"The model got smarter\" and \"users can access a smarter model\" are different milestones. From outside, we mostly see the second.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:55:16.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ThamasLi/status/2122131354804711436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122130833788068256", "author_id": "1976093411485569024", "text": "@kimmonismus They better get comfortable having a lot of resources available because everybody is jumping ship rn. Their models are useless.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:53:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/acasualnpc/status/2122130833788068256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122126713727660288", "author_id": "1894319334874329088", "text": "@kimmonismus also enterprises hate version churn. every new checkpoint means redoing all the evals again", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:36:50.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/choroukmalmoum/status/2122126713727660288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122126449251594392", "author_id": "2114906570303905792", "text": "@kimmonismus A checkpoint is only useful if it changes what people can build; shipping cadence matters less than the capability jump.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:35:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/BudgtStore/status/2122126449251594392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122125778347606500", "author_id": "1126207424602337280", "text": "@kimmonismus 这个逻辑其实很残酷：中间版本不发，不是因为做不出来，而是算力要留给能拉开代差的下一代。但用户是按月付费的，等不到新模型就会先去试 Claude 和 Gemini——研究进度和产品节奏，迟早得二选一。你们觉得 GPT-6 会直接跳号发布吗？", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:33:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TheEasySale1/status/2122125778347606500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122124968704225429", "author_id": "1574130042728509440", "text": "@pggalaviz @kimmonismus Inference is where the money goes, and I think that's the real constraint here. Frontier labs post tens of billions in losses against half-trillion compute commitments. At that burn rate, shipping every checkpoint makes little sense.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:29:54.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/wizardai_m/status/2122124968704225429", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122124676218429724", "author_id": "1104851004397371392", "text": "@kimmonismus I'd rather they wait and drop something that actually feels like a jump. Another small checkpoint every few weeks just blurs together for me!", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:28:44.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Itzkennybe/status/2122124676218429724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122124289159647722", "author_id": "1574130042728509440", "text": "@kimmonismus Pure speculation without telemetry, in my experience. Could equally be an eval gate or a benchmark regression. Closed labs give us nothing to verify either way, and that opacity is the transparency problem I keep coming back to.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:27:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/wizardai_m/status/2122124289159647722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122122852652679196", "author_id": "1523001709915688963", "text": "@kimmonismus they're not sitting on 6.2. they already decided that checkpoint isn't worth serving.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:21:29.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/kaveritaz/status/2122122852652679196", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122120351572509023", "author_id": "1858863448286969856", "text": "@kimmonismus Financing could exacerbate this problem.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:11:33.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Jackson77li/status/2122120351572509023", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122118085717213612", "author_id": "617640165", "text": "@kimmonismus OpenAI specifically wants to ship often because they feel dropping a huge increase in capabilities suddenly will be too disruptive. I don't think we will end up in a situation where updates stop unless they hard stop and internal models are kept internal due to safety concerns.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:02:33.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/BenPielstick/status/2122118085717213612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122117509088526562", "author_id": "1966018957904957440", "text": "@kimmonismus If checkpoints go stale that fast, skipping 6.2 for the next big jump makes sense. Does anyone actually miss a .2 release?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:00:15.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Mr_Bluezon/status/2122117509088526562", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122116617874350434", "author_id": "970795858190045187", "text": "@kimmonismus So the roadmap is just a GPU waitlist now 😅", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:56:43.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/CornKry/status/2122116617874350434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122115315656225014", "author_id": "1826745977891430400", "text": "@kimmonismus Makes sense. If the next checkpoint is clearly better, serving the in-between one just burns compute. Users still feel the gap though, and rivals are happy to fill it.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:51:32.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TechTvCh/status/2122115315656225014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1490950408272896085", "username": "daveylan2", "name": "Z.He", "verified": false}, {"id": "1573399256836309009", "username": "kimmonismus", "name": "Chubby♨️", "verified": false}, {"id": "2106392864544768000", "username": "ThamasLi", "name": "Thomas Li", "verified": false}, {"id": "1976093411485569024", "username": "acasualnpc", "name": "casualnpc", "verified": false}, {"id": "1894319334874329088", "username": "choroukmalmoum", "name": "Chorouk Malmoum", "verified": false}, {"id": "2114906570303905792", "username": "BudgtStore", "name": "BudgtStore", "verified": false}, {"id": "1126207424602337280", "username": "TheEasySale1", "name": "TheEasySale（互关，有关必回）", "verified": false}, {"id": "1574130042728509440", "username": "wizardai_m", "name": "Moez AI", "verified": false}, {"id": "162624081", "username": "pggalaviz", "name": "Pedro G", "verified": false}, {"id": "1104851004397371392", "username": "Itzkennybe", "name": "Itzkennybe", "verified": false}, {"id": "1523001709915688963", "username": "kaveritaz", "name": "kaveri", "verified": false}, {"id": "1858863448286969856", "username": "Jackson77li", "name": "Jackson li", "verified": false}, {"id": "617640165", "username": "BenPielstick", "name": "Ben Pielstick", "verified": false}, {"id": "1966018957904957440", "username": "Mr_Bluezon", "name": "Mr. ZON 🇰🇷", "verified": false}, {"id": "970795858190045187", "username": "CornKry", "name": "Corn", "verified": false}, {"id": "1826745977891430400", "username": "TechTvCh", "name": "Tech TV Channel", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122133801489084844", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzow6b6a501awm65t2162cyq7s48t", "oldest_id": "2122115315656225014", "result_count": 15}}